The arm required the battery to be connected, not charging, within 200 mA of zero current and with a battery-gauge reading no older than 180 s. Every slot records a battery reading before and after it, and a window with any failing or missing reading is not used and is replaced at most once (registration amendment A-R5b).
No model runs or measurement pack. No member values read before the session is terminal.
